# Contributor: waydroid-bluetooth
# Maintainer: waydroid-bluetooth
pkgname=waydroid-bt-lxc
pkgver=0.1.0
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="LXC mount fragment for waydroid-bt-host socket"
url="https://github.com/waydroid-bluetooth/waydroid-bluetooth"
arch="noarch"
license="MIT"
depends="waydroid waydroid-bt-host"
source=""
options="!check"

package() {
	install -Dm644 lxc/waydroid-bt-mount.conf \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/share/waydroid-bt/lxc-mount.conf
	install -Dm644 lxc/waydroid-bt-mount.conf \
		"$pkgdir"/etc/waydroid-bt/lxc-mount.conf

	# Install helper that appends the mount entry if missing.
	install -Dm755 packaging/postmarketos/waydroid-bt-lxc/apply-lxc-mount.sh \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/bin/waydroid-bt-apply-lxc-mount
}
